# ==============================================================================
# stormlab pipeline outputs
# ==============================================================================
# Working copies of INP files (SWMM writes .rpt/.out/.bak next to its input)
work/
# Per-run results; results/golden/ stays tracked on purpose
results/runs/
# Generated synthetic SWMM networks (deterministic, reproducible from seed).
# Both spellings: with the trailing slash git ignores the directory, without it
# also the read-only symlink a worktree uses to share one pool between checkouts
# -- which would otherwise be committed as an absolute path to somebody's disk.
data/generated/
data/generated
# Archived copies of a frozen INP pool (`c1-build-cases --archive-pool`). The pool
# directories above are already untracked, so an archive of them is a second copy
# of untracked bytes, not a new tracked input; what identifies the population is
# the run's input_manifest.json, which is tracked nowhere else either.
data/archive/
# Evaluation INP and manifests are tracked; SWMM sidecars beside them never are.
data/eval/**/*.rpt
data/eval/**/*.out
data/eval/**/*.bak
word/media/
word/Doktorat_Zotero.md
.agents/*/
word/

# ==============================================================================
# Local ML model weights & research artifacts (excluded before publication)
# ==============================================================================
*.keras
*.weights.h5
app/sa/core/recommendations/*.spec.json
app/sa/core/recommendations/c3c_imputation_plan.json
app/sa/core/tests/fixtures/gnn_golden_fixture.npz
